{
  "_comment": [
    "The whole S1 LL route, by one drone, with no model in the loop.",
    "",
    "Ten plans, one per route node, each the same four actions: go to the",
    "die, take it, go to the next support, put it down. The n-th plan is",
    "handed out on the team's n-th round, so the route is walked in order",
    "and RouteTracker credits the nodes as they land.",
    "",
    "It is one robot because it can be. The die is 8 g and the lift table",
    "says arm OR drone, and a drone has no base lock -- so unlike the LH",
    "notebook this cargo needs no carrier and no handoff, and a single",
    "drone flying the whole route is the honest shape of this task. Every",
    "tag/individual episode that solves LL converges on exactly this; the",
    "script only removes the rounds the teams spend discovering it.",
    "",
    "Run with coop2/team_layouts/s1/sets_1.json (ridgeback_1, jackal_1,",
    "drone_1). The other two are unscripted and hold position throughout."
  ],
